WEBVTT

00:13:25.579 --> 00:13:30.121
and just build relationships with people
who can help me in whatever my next

00:13:30.121 --> 00:13:31.204
phase of life was going to be.

00:13:31.454 --> 00:13:36.204
Second on the list, stop engaging in
what Janice calls energy zaps.

00:13:36.996 --> 00:13:40.287
Yeah, energy zaps, not interacting with,
you know,

00:13:40.329 --> 00:13:44.954
what I call problematic people to go back
to the relationship comparison.

00:13:45.246 --> 00:13:48.454
I guess I became emotionally
unavailable at work.

00:13:48.829 --> 00:13:52.746
Her third step was to leverage her
company's perks, to broaden her horizons

00:13:52.912 --> 00:13:58.079
is basically just trying to max out
what was available to me then.

00:13:58.121 --> 00:14:02.454
One in particular is that we
got to go to conferences.